{
  "id": "G3A1J6iSFiTDvWT8_quicklink",
  "name": "WF-CHATWOOT-ATTRS — Fase 3_quicklink",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-c3-001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-CHATWOOT-ATTRS — Fase 3\n\n**Objetivo:** Aplicar labels en conversación\ny sincronizar atributos en contacto Chatwoot.\n\n**Labels:** marca (kia/hyundai) + estado CRIS\n**Attrs:** marca, modelo, quicklink_id, estado_cris\n**Tracker:** eventos_conversacion (chatwoot_labels_aplicados)\n**Pre-req:** Fase 1 + 2 completadas",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cron-c3-001",
      "name": "CRON - Cada 5 Min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pg-c3-001",
      "name": "PG - Get No Labels",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        260,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT c.id AS conv_id, c.nombre, c.marca, c.modelo, c.estado, c.quicklink_id, c.chatwoot_conv_id, c.chatwoot_contact_id FROM conversaciones c WHERE c.chatwoot_conv_id IS NOT NULL AND c.chatwoot_contact_id IS NOT NULL AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM eventos_conversacion e WHERE e.conversation_id = c.id AND e.tipo_evento = 'chatwoot_labels_aplicados') AND c.estado NOT IN ('PENDIENTE','DESCARTADO') ORDER BY c.created_at ASC LIMIT 50",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "bpXsDuBulR5Lk1Yf_quicklink",
          "name": "Supabase VPS_QUICKLINK"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loop-c3-001",
      "name": "Loop - Each Conv",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        520,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-c3-done",
      "name": "Set - Attrs Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        740,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "attrs_done",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "finished_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-c3-build",
      "name": "Code - Build Labels Attrs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\n\nconst sanitize = s => (s || '').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '-').replace(/^-|-$/g, '').substring(0, 25);\n\nconst marcaLabel = sanitize(item.marca);\nconst estadoLabel = sanitize(item.estado);\nconst labels = [marcaLabel, estadoLabel].filter(Boolean);\n\nconst labelsBody = JSON.stringify({ labels });\n\nconst contactAttrsBody = JSON.stringify({\n  additional_attributes: {\n    marca: item.marca || '',\n    modelo: item.modelo || '',\n    quicklink_id: item.quicklink_id || '',\n    estado_cris: item.estado || ''\n  }\n});\n\nconst eventoPayload = JSON.stringify({\n  labels,\n  chatwoot_conv_id: item.chatwoot_conv_id,\n  chatwoot_contact_id: item.chatwoot_contact_id\n}).replace(/'/g, \"''\");\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    conv_id: item.conv_id,\n    chatwoot_conv_id: item.chatwoot_conv_id,\n    chatwoot_contact_id: item.chatwoot_contact_id,\n    labels_body: labelsBody,\n    contact_attrs_body: contactAttrsBody,\n    evento_payload: eventoPayload\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-c3-labels",
      "name": "HTTP - Post Labels",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "notes": "WF-09 TagManager owns Chatwoot labels. This node intentionally preserves the execution chain without writing labels."
    },
    {
      "id": "http-c3-contact",
      "name": "HTTP - Update Contact Attrs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        280
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=http://172.18.0.24:3000/api/v1/accounts/2/contacts/{{ $('Code - Build Labels Attrs').first().json.chatwoot_contact_id }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ $('Code - Build Labels Attrs').first().json.contact_attrs_body }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "i5ezyRiVmSifQ3el_quicklink",
          "name": "Chatwoot API_QUICKLINK"
        }
      }
    },
    {
